  "description": "Gulf Shores is an upbeat yet relaxed beach town where you can slow down, unwind and reconnect with yourself and your family along 32 miles of sugar-white sands and mesmerizing emerald waters. Combining the best of Alabama's Southern hospitality with a distinct island flair, Paradise Isle Resort is an oasis of tranquility. Enjoy a relaxing stay in well-appointed comfort in a 1-bedroom or 2-bedroom deluxe suite featuring full kitchens and baths and separate living and dining areas that can accommodate from 4 to 6 guests. The beach is right across the street from Paradise Isle Resort. Spend the day basking in the sun on powdery white sand. Grab a boogie board and catch a wave. Experience the thrill of jet skiing or parasailing. When you return from the beach, rinse off the salt water with a refreshing plunge in the resort's outdoor pool. Grill up the day's catch from your deep-sea fishing adventure along with some juicy steaks to create a memorable outdoor surf and turf feast at sunset. Cap off the perfect day with a relaxing hot tub soak while mild Gulf breezes soothe you.",
